  "details": "Some features I'd like to suggest for the whole 18+ verification update. \n\nSuggestion:\n\nany avatar that is tagged NSFW or anything inappropriate should be only available to people who have verified there accounts. Any account that is under the age of 18 won't be able to view a NSFW avatar. \n\n2.if a unverified account managed to wear a 18+ avatar then they will be met with the default bot with the words on its chest \"18+ accounts only\" or an imposter. \n\nBenefits:\n\n1.it will improve minor safety and become a safer platform for unfortunate kids that join a random lobby and see something kids shouldn't see. \n\n2. Little kids shouldn't be playing this game I know but  that doesn't stop neglectful parents to let a headset babysit there kid\n\n3. I don't see a problem with this and those who do see a problem with this are probably minors or worse.",
